sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant V as Version coordinator
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant R as Active role
    participant T as Tool runtime

    U->>V: New message or correction
    V->>O: Commit current version and build work memory
    O->>R: Grant role lease / resume lease
    R->>R: Understand, set goals, deliver stage value
    alt Tool result changes current action
        R->>T: Authorize, ground, compile, invoke
        T-->>R: Evidence envelope or technical failure
        R->>R: Interpret evidence or retain conditional value
    end
    R-->>V: Professional detail + collaboration brief + waiting reason
    V-->>U: Lossless natural delivery and next state
    Note over V,O: Technical failure never means close the whole meeting
